Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 14:35:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: support ddrperfm on stm32mp257f-dk (FIX)

Enable the peripheral in the board file.

Signed-off-by: Antonio Borneo <antonio.borneo@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: Ie4dca3e9b5a66b49d31bd27b7c4b20b3938d64c7
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/571223
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-dk.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-dk.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-dk.dts
index d49f41a12168..a196cb21cee9 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-dk.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-dk.dts
@@ -358,7 +358,7 @@ dcmipp_0: endpoint {
 
 &ddrperfm {
 	memory-channel = <&lpddr_channel>;
-	status = "disabled";
+	status = "okay";
 };
 
 &dsi {
